  "claim": "Target121 u20874 is the complete adaptive PR-refresh delay selector owned by src/components/FleetView.tsx. It is a new top-level function inserted at the exact FleetView module boundary that is adjacent in Target120. Its sole call is inside FleetView, where getTerminalFocused() and elapsed time since getLastInteractionTime() select the delay and a dedicated timestamp ref gates the PR batch. Recovered Target120, Target121, and fresh-package FleetView source all retain the old unconditional PR fetch and omit the helper, timestamp ref, focus reset, and import, so this is a static complete-unit proof and never a partial source replay.",
